{"id":"en_a-spring-yet-to-come","title":"A Spring Yet to Come","titleEn":"A Spring Yet to Come","description":"The daughter of the Shangshu Mansion set her sights on becoming queen. After her engagement, she devoted three years to supporting the third prince, only for him to force her to step aside in favor of his sister. Refusing to accept this, she resolutely shifted her allegiance to the eldest prince. She helped him overcome a long-standing illness, and through her efforts he rose to the position of crown prince.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/a-spring-yet-to-come/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/a-spring-yet-to-come/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Ancient","Polyamory","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7duy9k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_a-spring-yet-to-come_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7duy9k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_a-spring-yet-to-come_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7duy9k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_a-spring-yet-to-come_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7duy9k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_a-spring-yet-to-come_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7duy9k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_a-spring-yet-to-come_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-